```spl
* ============================================================================
* E01 - Historian vs live PLC value divergence  (Stuxnet-class)
* Read-only. Schedule every 1m over a 5m window.
* Requires the SAME tags from two independent sources:
*   source=hmi_historian  and  source=direct_opcua
* Data model: docs/data-model.md
* ============================================================================

index=ot_historian sourcetype=historian:snapshot quality=Good
    (source="hmi_historian" OR source="direct_opcua")
    tag IN ("PLANT1.*.PV")

* Align both sources to a common 10s bin
| bin _time span=10s

* Pivot the two sources into two columns within each (tag,bin)
| stats
    latest(eval(if(source=="hmi_historian", value, null()))) as v_hist
    latest(eval(if(source=="direct_opcua",  value, null()))) as v_direct
    by tag _time

* Only compare bins where BOTH independent sources produced a Good value
| where isnotnull(v_hist) AND isnotnull(v_direct)

* Scale tolerance to the tag's own noise (sigma) and add a percent floor
| lookup ot_baseline.csv tag OUTPUT std
| eval abs_diff  = abs(v_hist - v_direct)
| eval pct_diff  = round(100 * abs_diff / abs(coalesce(v_direct,1)), 2)
| eval sigma_diff = round(abs_diff / coalesce(std, abs_diff), 2)

* Divergence condition
| eval diverged = if(sigma_diff > 3 OR pct_diff > 2, 1, 0)

* Persistence: require >= 2 consecutive divergent bins per tag
| sort 0 tag _time
| streamstats reset_before="(diverged==0)" count as diverge_run by tag
| where diverged==1 AND diverge_run>=2

| eval detection="E01", severity="high"
| table _time tag v_hist v_direct abs_diff pct_diff sigma_diff diverge_run severity detection
| sort - _time
```
